it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "by Thursday. I don''t"}, {"Item": "CS3", "Item text": "\"could be built in three weeks by one engineer\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "could be built in three weeks by one engineer"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-5", "workplace_demand": "Holding a commitment another person made to customers.", "relevant_conduct": "What the submission states about who holds the commitment now; what is stated to each lead and to the vice-president; the account of how the commitment arose; whether the customer success lead is named and whether the naming is supported; the steps named and their holders.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Whether the recommendation is commercially right; the trust history between the two teams; the fundraising context.", "stated_standard": "\"Own this. Bring me a recommendation by Thursday.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"Own this. Bring me a recommendation by Thursday\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Extended time and assistive software permitted and recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the customer success lead acted wrongly; that naming the premature commitment is blame; that not naming it is diplomacy.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "item_ownership_state": "Unassigned as to the commitment; held_by_participant as to the resolution.", "knowledge_point": "When the escalation reached the participant.", "impact_point": "Six weeks, the customers'' stated deadline; Thursday for the recommendation.", "enquiry_note": "The vice-president''s instruction.", "affected_party": "the vice-president", "affected_party_note": "Both leads are further affected parties.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state who now holds the customer commitment"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "surface the partial option to both leads"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "state the decision criteria"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that the commitment was made without consulting engineering or product"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that a partial option exists and has not been discussed"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the performance work affects all customers"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the customer success lead told the customers the feature was on the roadmap"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "she did so without consulting engineering or product"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "she acknowledges it was premature"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "a partial option exists that touches neither workstream"}], "attribution_support_set": [{"id": "AS1", "text": "the commitment to the customers was made without consulting engineering or product"}], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the customer success lead"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the engineering lead"}, {"id": "AA3", "text": "the vice-president"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"within six weeks\""}, {"id": "CS2", "text": "\"by Thursday\""}, {"id": "CS3", "text": "\"could be built in three weeks by one engineer\""}], "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A shortfall arising from another person''s work or an inherited state the person now holds", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S3-009", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "e5359a029dbe0f43f32d7a63052fc73c8b1ac995cd1b5e37478851157413d15c", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S3-009' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-001', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE MILESTONE THAT WAS NOT MET', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE MILESTONE THAT WAS NOT MET", "source_digest": "3c063e702b73af08a7acc6421267fd0dfe5cd5bbb857097813d276750adb2815", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a cross-functional team rolling out a new system across three regional offices. The completion date is fixed and tied to a board commitment. Last Friday''s milestone — data migration and acceptance testing for the first office — was not met. Migration is seventy per cent complete and testing has not started. You owned the data migration. You knew last Tuesday that it would not finish, because the second extract had not been validated. You have not told anyone that you knew on Tuesday. The project sponsor expects a status update this morning and does not yet know the milestone was missed. The team is meeting now to prepare.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thanks everyone. Friday''s milestone was not met. This is to get the sequence straight before the sponsor call, not to allocate fault. I will go round in this order — acceptance testing, office readiness, schedule, then data migration. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Data migration. How did that run?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The sponsor will ask for a recovery date this morning. Can migration commit to one?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has to change before the next milestone, and who does it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know migration would not finish by Friday?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the preparation. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You owned acceptance testing; state that you could not start because migration was incomplete."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You owned the office readiness workstream; state that yours is complete and on time."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You coordinate the schedule; state that the completion date is fixed by the board and cannot move."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "P-OBS owns migration; B2 and B3 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "ACT-01 to ACT-03 eligible; ACT-04 not"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The affected party is represented at the table"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point already passed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set non-empty"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "attribution_support_set non-empty"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Naming another strand resolves to UNSUPPORTED_ATTRIBUTION"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a commitment against a fixed date"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that migration is seventy per cent complete", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "Migration is seventy per cent complete"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that P-OBS knew on Tuesday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "knew last Tuesday that"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the second extract was not validated", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "second extract had not been validated"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the second extract was not validated", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "second extract had not been validated"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "migration is seventy per cent complete", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "Migration is seventy per cent complete"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "acceptance testing has not started", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "acceptance testing for the"}, {"Item": "AS1", "Item text": "the second extract was not validated", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "second extract had not been validated"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"a fixed completion date\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "completion date is fixed"}, {"Item": "CS2", "Item text": "\"a recovery date this morning\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "a recovery date this morning"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-4", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for one''s own strand of a missed milestone in front of the peers it affected.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding migration; whether the Tuesday knowledge was stated and when; what was stated to the team; the account of cause; whether other strands were named; the recovery commitment; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The conduct of CP-1, CP-2 or CP-3, which is scripted and never recorded; P-OBS''s manner.", "stated_standard": "\"The completion date is fixed and tied to a board commitment.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"The completion date is fixed and tied to a board commitment\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set `timing_not_comparable`.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS caused the milestone slip; that not stating the Tuesday knowledge earlier was concealment; that any strand performed better or worse.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Held_by_participant.", "knowledge_point": "Last Tuesday, when the second extract was not validated.", "impact_point": "Last Friday, the milestone date, already passed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the project sponsor", "affected_party_note": "Through the facilitator.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state the Tuesday knowledge in the B2 round before being asked"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state the seventy per cent position"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "name a recovery date at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that migration is seventy per cent complete"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that P-OBS knew on Tuesday"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the second extract was not validated"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the second extract was not validated"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "migration is seventy per cent complete"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "acceptance testing has not started"}], "attribution_support_set": [{"id": "AS1", "text": "the second extract was not validated"}], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the project sponsor"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the facilitator"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"a fixed completion date\""}, {"id": "CS2", "text": "\"a recovery date this morning\""}], "list_note": "Not selectable, planning content only: validate the extract. CP-1''s position that testing could not start because migration was incomplete is A CHARACTER STATEMENT AND IS NOT SELECTABLE.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A completed failure under review, with contribution spread across several people on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-001", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "3c063e702b73af08a7acc6421267fd0dfe5cd5bbb857097813d276750adb2815", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-001' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-002', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE MODEL WITH THE CALCULATION ERRORS', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE MODEL WITH THE CALCULATION ERRORS", "source_digest": "aeec4c20cbd63a9624af2ad7e0cf75058d8d0a8ec5597467244474664355142e", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a client services team. This morning the largest client organization sent a formal complaint to your managing director. A financial model your team delivered last week contained calculation errors, and the client presented incorrect projections to their board. The model was collaborative and each of you touched it at different stages. You built the projection formulas in the sheet that produced the errors. You ran your own check on the Thursday before delivery and it flagged two inconsistencies. You resolved one and left the other, intending to return to it. You did not return to it and did not raise it. The managing director has called a meeting in thirty minutes.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "You have all seen the letter. The model we delivered had calculation errors and the client organization put incorrect projections in front of their board. I want the sequence before I reply. I will go round in this order — source data, formatting and submission, engagement lead, then projections. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The projection formulas. Can you walk me through what happened?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "I have to write to the client organization today. What can I tell them about the fix and when?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What changes before the next model goes out, and who makes that change?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first see an inconsistency in the projection sheet?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. I will draft the reply.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You assembled the source data; state that the inputs you supplied were verified against the client''s own files."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You did the final formatting and submission; state that you had one afternoon and did no content review."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You are the engagement lead; state that the review step was skipped because of the delivery date."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Ownership contested; B2 and B3 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The managing director is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point passed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set has four items"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The opportunity to attribute is genuine and three co-participants have just offered framings"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a commitment"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that P-OBS''s own check flagged two inconsistencies on Thursday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "own check on the Thursday before delivery and it flagged two inconsistencies"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that one was resolved and one was not", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You resolved one and left the other, intending to return to it"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the unresolved one was not raised", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You did not return to it and did not raise it"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "P-OBS built the projection formulas", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "built the projection formulas"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "P-OBS''s check on Thursday flagged two inconsistencies", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "check on the Thursday before delivery and it flagged two inconsistencies"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "one was resolved and one was left", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "resolved one and left"}, {"Item": "CR4", "Item text": "it was not raised before delivery", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You did not return to it and did not raise it"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"today\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "today. What can I"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-4", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for an error one detected and did not raise.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding the projection sheet; whether the Thursday check was stated and when; what was stated about the unresolved inconsistency; the account of cause; whether other stages were named; the fix commitment; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The conduct of the co-participants; the client organization''s reaction; the financial content.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS intended to return to the inconsistency or did not; that leaving one flagged item was careless; anything about thoroughness.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Contested. The model was collaborative; the projection formulas were P-OBS''s.", "knowledge_point": "The Thursday before delivery, when P-OBS''s own check flagged two inconsistencies.", "impact_point": "Delivery last week, and the client''s board presentation. Already passed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the managing director", "affected_party_note": "And through them the client organization.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state the Thursday check and its two flags"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state which inconsistency was left"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit a fix time at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that P-OBS''s own check flagged two inconsistencies on Thursday"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that one was resolved and one was not"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the unresolved one was not raised"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "P-OBS built the projection formulas"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "P-OBS''s check on Thursday flagged two inconsistencies"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "one was resolved and one was left"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "it was not raised before delivery"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the managing director"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the engagement lead"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"today\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none. THE RECORD SUPPORTS NO ATTRIBUTION TO ANOTHER PERSON. Every co-participant position is a character statement and none is selectable. Only UNSUPPORTED_ATTRIBUTION is reachable where an attribution is made. Exact text at B4.", "source_note": "Recorded as explicit none. NO SOURCE TEXT ESTABLISHES A REVIEW REQUIREMENT, and CP-3''s statement that a review step was skipped is a character statement, not a standard.", "situation_class_label": "A completed failure under review, with contribution spread across several people on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-002", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "aeec4c20cbd63a9624af2ad7e0cf75058d8d0a8ec5597467244474664355142e", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-002' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-003', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE REPORT NOBODY OWNS', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE REPORT NOBODY OWNS", "source_digest": "42f2dfa1ab24f6d8ad9ee8f3bf7c5c8bea3a94845daf0517045e04da8ff34e6b", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a marketing operations team. Two weeks ago a colleague resigned abruptly. They were the sole owner of the quarterly client retention report, which goes to the executive team and to all major clients. It is due in five working days. No one has touched it. There is no documented process. The data sits across three platforms and the departed colleague used custom formulas in a spreadsheet nobody else has seen. You are the only person on the team with access to all three platforms, and you have known that since the colleague left. Your manager has called this meeting: figure out who is owning this and how it gets done.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The retention report goes out in five working days and nobody has picked it up since the resignation. This meeting is to work out who is owning it and how it gets done. I will go round in this order — platform access, current commitments, recommendation, then open. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where do you think this sits?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "It is due in five days. Can this team commit to that date?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What is the first step, and who takes it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know you were the only person with access to all three platforms?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the meeting. Thank you.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "State that you have never had access to the billing platform."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "State that you are fully committed to a campaign launch in the same week."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "State that you think the report should be postponed and the executive team told."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "item_ownership_state unassigned. THE STRONGEST CE-D2-01 SOURCE IN THE STAGE 4 BANK"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The manager is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point in five days, in the future"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3, both reachable"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set has four items"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "attribution_support_set non-empty and supported"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "The departed colleague is NEVER NAMED in a rendered statement"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a first step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a commitment against a stated date"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that P-OBS holds access to all three platforms", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "access to all three platforms"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that no documented process exists", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "is no documented process"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the custom formulas have not been seen", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "custom formulas in a spreadsheet nobody else has seen"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the colleague resigned two weeks ago", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "weeks ago a colleague resigned"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "they were sole owner of the report", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "sole owner of the quarterly client retention report"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "no documented process exists", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "is no documented process"}, {"Item": "CR4", "Item text": "nobody has touched it since", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B1", "Quoted text": "nobody has picked it up since"}, {"Item": "AS1", "Item text": "no handover documentation was left", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "There is no documented process"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"five working days\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "five working days. No"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-1", "workplace_demand": "An unassigned deliverable with an approaching external consequence.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about who holds the report; whether the access position was stated and when; the account of the situation; whether the departed colleague was named; the first step and its holder; the commitment against five days; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The departed colleague''s conduct; the co-participants'' positions; the merits of postponing.", "stated_standard": "\"It is due in five working days.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"It is due in five working days\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS should claim it; that holding the access and not saying so earlier means anything; anything about initiative.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Unassigned.", "knowledge_point": "Two weeks ago, when the colleague left and P-OBS knew they held sole platform access.", "impact_point": "Five working days from now, in the future.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the manager", "affected_party_note": "Facilitating.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state that P-OBS holds access to all three platforms"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state who will carry the report"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit to the five-day date at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that P-OBS holds access to all three platforms"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that no documented process exists"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the custom formulas have not been seen"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the colleague resigned two weeks ago"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "they were sole owner of the report"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "no documented process exists"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "nobody has touched it since"}], "attribution_support_set": [{"id": "AS1", "text": "no handover documentation was left"}], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the manager"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the two co-participants'' roles"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"five working days\""}], "list_note": "Exact pre-brief text.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "An unassigned or contested work item with a deadline approaching, and a record of who was asked", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-003", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "42f2dfa1ab24f6d8ad9ee8f3bf7c5c8bea3a94845daf0517045e04da8ff34e6b", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-003' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-004', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE BUDGET ALREADY OVER', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE BUDGET ALREADY OVER", "source_digest": "28505854dea47c9afe6cc2420f694923286db1694691c7d50beb37c95f8a1d32", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on an events team running a leadership retreat for the client organization. The approved budget is eighty-five thousand dollars. The retreat is in ten days. This morning the spend report shows ninety-seven thousand four hundred spent already, with about twenty-two thousand still to come — a projected final of roughly one hundred and nineteen thousand four hundred, a forty per cent overrun. You approved the venue upgrade three weeks ago that accounts for about nine thousand of the overspend. You did not route it for approval because you believed it was within your discretion. The contract requires client approval for overruns above fifteen per cent before the firm can invoice. The project director has not seen these numbers. The team is meeting now.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The spend report this morning puts us at ninety-seven thousand four hundred against an eighty-five thousand budget, with about twenty-two thousand still to come. I want to understand the lines before the director sees it. I will go round in this order — finance, catering and audiovisual, travel, then venue. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The venue line. What happened there?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The director will ask this afternoon whether we can bring the projection down. Can you commit to a number?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has to happen before the retreat, and who does it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know the venue upgrade would take us over the approved budget?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. I will take it to the director.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You are the finance coordinator; state the figures as given and nothing more."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold catering and audiovisual; state that your lines are on budget."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold travel; state that travel is nine per cent over because of a date change requested by the client organization."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The venue decision is P-OBS''s"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The affected party is represented by the facilitator"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "FOUR MATERIAL ITEMS"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point already crossed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set has four items"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three co-participants have just offered lines that could be attributed to"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a number"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that P-OBS approved the venue upgrade", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "approved the venue upgrade"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that it was not routed for approval", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You did not route it for approval"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that it accounts for about nine thousand of the overspend", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "accounts for about nine thousand of the overspend"}, {"Item": "MD4", "Item text": "that the contract threshold has been crossed", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "The contract requires client approval for overruns above fifteen per cent"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the venue upgrade accounts for about nine thousand", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "venue upgrade three weeks ago that accounts for about nine thousand"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "it was not routed for approval", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You did not route it for approval"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "the projected final is about one hundred and nineteen thousand four hundred", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "thousand four hundred spent already, with about twenty-two thousand still to come — a projected final of roughly one hundred and nineteen"}, {"Item": "CR4", "Item text": "the contract threshold is fifteen per cent", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "contract requires client approval for overruns above fifteen per cent"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"eighty-five thousand dollars\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "eighty-five thousand dollars. The"}, {"Item": "CS2", "Item text": "\"fifteen per cent\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "fifteen per cent before"}, {"Item": "CS3", "Item text": "\"ten days\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "ten days. This morning"}, {"Item": "CS4", "Item text": "\"this afternoon\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "this afternoon whether we"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-2", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for a spending decision one made without routing it.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding the venue decision; whether the unrouted approval was stated and when; what was stated about the contract threshold; the account of cause; whether the client''s date change or another line was named; the commitment at B4; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' lines; the merits of the venue upgrade; the client organization''s date change.", "stated_standard": "\"The contract requires client approval for overruns above fifteen per cent before the firm can invoice.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"The contract requires client approval for overruns above fifteen per cent before the firm can invoice\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS exceeded their authority; that believing it was within discretion was unreasonable; anything about judgment.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Held_by_participant as to the venue line.", "knowledge_point": "Three weeks ago, when the upgrade was approved.", "impact_point": "The fifteen per cent contract threshold, already crossed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the project director", "affected_party_note": "Through the facilitator.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state that the venue upgrade was not routed"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state the contract threshold position"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit a revised number at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that P-OBS approved the venue upgrade"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that it was not routed for approval"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that it accounts for about nine thousand of the overspend"}, {"id": "MD4", "text": "that the contract threshold has been crossed"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the venue upgrade accounts for about nine thousand"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "it was not routed for approval"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "the projected final is about one hundred and nineteen thousand four hundred"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "the contract threshold is fifteen per cent"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the project director"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the client organization"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"eighty-five thousand dollars\""}, {"id": "CS2", "text": "\"fifteen per cent\""}, {"id": "CS3", "text": "\"ten days\""}, {"id": "CS4", "text": "\"this afternoon\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none as to the venue line. CP-3''s statement about the client''s date change is A CHARACTER STATEMENT and is not selectable, even though it is plausible.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A shortfall the person contributed to, not yet known to the affected party, with its cause on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-004", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "28505854dea47c9afe6cc2420f694923286db1694691c7d50beb37c95f8a1d32", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-004' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-005', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE HANDOVER THAT LEFT THREE ITEMS OUT', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE HANDOVER THAT LEFT THREE ITEMS OUT", "source_digest": "90efb0aa980368294039ee362acf54aa4f26d8af4083627a803ad3f254a11320", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a support operations team running two shifts with a structured handover at each change: open tickets, escalated issues, pending callbacks, system alerts. You were on the day shift yesterday and you gave the handover. Three items were not mentioned: an outage affecting more than two hundred users at the largest enterprise client, a pending callback to a client executive waiting since noon, and a security alert requiring investigation. The evening shift found them at 5:00 PM when the enterprise client''s technology director called. You had the outage on your screen at 2:40 PM and meant to add it to the handover sheet. The operations manager has called this meeting.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Three items did not make yesterday''s handover and the enterprise client found them before we did. I want the sequence, not fault. I will go round in this order — evening shift, handover template, day shift, then the person who gave the handover. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "You gave the handover. How did it run?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The enterprise client wants a position by end of day. Can you commit to one?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What changes before the next handover, and who makes it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first see the outage?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. That is what I needed.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You were on the evening shift; state when you found each item and what state it was in."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You maintain the handover template; state that the template has fields for all four categories."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You were also on the day shift; state that the shift was unusually busy."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "P-OBS gave the handover"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The operations manager is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point passed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set has four items and an EXPLICIT STATED STANDARD to compare against"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The opportunity is genuine"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a change"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a commitment"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that three items were omitted", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "Three items were not"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that P-OBS gave the handover", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "you gave the handover"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that P-OBS saw the outage at 2:40 PM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You had the outage on your screen at 2:40 PM"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the handover covers four categories", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "open tickets, escalated issues, pending callbacks, system alerts"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "three items were not mentioned", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "Three items were not mentioned"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "P-OBS gave the handover", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "you gave the handover"}, {"Item": "CR4", "Item text": "P-OBS saw the outage at 2:40 PM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You had the outage on your screen at 2:40 PM"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"by end of day\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "by end of day"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-4", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for an omission in a process one performed.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding the handover; whether the 2:40 PM sighting was stated and when; the account of cause; whether the busy shift or the template was named; the change named and its holder; the commitment; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' statements; the technical nature of the outage; the enterprise client''s reaction.", "stated_standard": "\"a structured handover at each change: open tickets, escalated issues, pending callbacks, system alerts.\" Exact pre-brief text. THE STANDARD IS EXPLICIT AND WAS NOT MET.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a structured handover at each change: open tickets, escalated issues, pending callbacks, system alerts\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS was negligent; that the busy shift excuses or does not excuse the omission; anything about attention to detail.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Held_by_participant.", "knowledge_point": "2:40 PM yesterday, when the outage was on P-OBS''s screen.", "impact_point": "3:00 PM, the shift change. Already passed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the operations manager", "affected_party_note": "Facilitating.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state that the three items were not handed over"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state the 2:40 PM sighting"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit a client position at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that three items were omitted"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that P-OBS gave the handover"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that P-OBS saw the outage at 2:40 PM"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the handover covers four categories"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "three items were not mentioned"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "P-OBS gave the handover"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "P-OBS saw the outage at 2:40 PM"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the operations manager"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"by end of day\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none. CP-3''s statement that the shift was unusually busy is A CHARACTER STATEMENT and is not selectable. Exact text at B4.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A completed failure under review, with contribution spread across several people on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-005", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "90efb0aa980368294039ee362acf54aa4f26d8af4083627a803ad3f254a11320", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-005' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-006', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE LAUNCH THAT FAILED IN FORTY-EIGHT HOURS', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE LAUNCH THAT FAILED IN FORTY-EIGHT HOURS", "source_digest": "d51178262ba7b766d63545079a2fd7047b8b3d5c5f893ddae5a7649ed53eb7f1", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a product team. Last week your team launched a new client onboarding portal. It was promoted by the chief executive at an all-hands and the sales team has been telling prospects about it for months. In the first forty-eight hours the portal crashed twice at peak, three clients reported data not saving, the linked training videos return errors, and support ticket volume has tripled. You owned release readiness. You signed the go decision on the Thursday before launch with two load-test items still open. The vice-president of product has called a post-mortem and asked for facts, not fault.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The portal launched last week and has not held up. Two crashes at peak, data not saving for three clients, broken training links, ticket volume tripled. I want to understand what went wrong and who owns what. Facts, not fault. I will go round in this order — content, support, engineering, then release readiness. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Release readiness. How did the go decision get made?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The chief executive will ask for a stabilisation date tomorrow. Can you commit to one?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What changes before the next release, and who makes that change?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know the two load-test items were still open?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You owned the client-facing content; state that the training videos were published to a staging path that was never switched."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You owned support; state that ticket volume tripled and your team had no advance briefing."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You owned engineering; state that the two open load-test items were flagged in the release channel on the Wednesday."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "P-OBS owned release readiness"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The vice-president is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point passed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set non-empty"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THREE co-participants have offered attributable framings — the most attribution pressure in the bank"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a change"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a date"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that P-OBS signed the go decision", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "signed the go decision"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that two load-test items were open at the time", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "load-test items still open"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the decision was taken on the Thursday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "decision on the Thursday"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "P-OBS owned release readiness", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You owned release readiness"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "the go decision was signed on the Thursday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "signed the go decision on the Thursday"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "two load-test items were open at that point", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "load-test items still open"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"tomorrow\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "tomorrow. Can you commit"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-4", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for a release decision one signed with known items open.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding the go decision; whether the two open items were stated and when; the account of cause; whether content, support or engineering was named; the change and its holder; the stabilisation commitment; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' positions; the technical cause of the crashes; the chief executive''s promotion of the launch.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That signing with two items open was wrong; that P-OBS ignored a flag; anything about risk tolerance.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Held_by_participant as to release readiness.", "knowledge_point": "The Thursday before launch, when the go decision was signed with two items open.", "impact_point": "The launch, already passed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the vice-president of product", "affected_party_note": "Facilitating.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state that two load-test items were open at the go decision"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state who signed the decision"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit a stabilisation date at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that P-OBS signed the go decision"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that two load-test items were open at the time"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the decision was taken on the Thursday"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "P-OBS owned release readiness"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "the go decision was signed on the Thursday"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "two load-test items were open at that point"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the vice-president of product"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"tomorrow\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none. All three co-participant positions are character statements and none is selectable, including the staging-path claim, which is plausible and unverified. Exact text at B4.", "source_note": "Recorded as explicit none. NO SOURCE TEXT ESTABLISHES A RULE THAT A GO DECISION REQUIRES ZERO OPEN ITEMS, and CP-3''s statement that the items were flagged is a character statement, not a standard.", "situation_class_label": "A completed failure under review, with contribution spread across several people on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-006", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "d51178262ba7b766d63545079a2fd7047b8b3d5c5f893ddae5a7649ed53eb7f1", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-006' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-007', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'WHO PRESENTS WHICH SECTIONS', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "WHO PRESENTS WHICH SECTIONS", "source_digest": "26ceadd7cf7ad053cbd2c0e94010a4eafacf623518931725f4a19b6345239937", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a strategy team. Over three weeks your team built a growth strategy presentation for the client organization. The final presentation is tomorrow. The document version history records that you produced the market analysis, the competitive landscape and the financial projections, which is about sixty per cent of the content. Your team lead has called this meeting to decide who presents which sections, and has said the client should know who drove what because it matters for the relationship.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The presentation is tomorrow and I want to settle who presents what. The client should know who drove which parts — it matters for the relationship. I will go round in this order — synthesis and recommendations, production support, newest member, then analysis. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Which sections would you present?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "I want a line in the deck naming who drove what. What should it say for your sections?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What would you change about how we divide work next time, and who makes that change?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first see that the version history records the analysis sections against you?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Good. I will put the running order together.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You produced the interview synthesis and the recommendations section; state what you produced."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You did formatting, scheduling and minor research support; state that you contributed throughout."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You are a fourth team member who joined last week; state that you have no section."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE PRIMARY ELEMENT. Ownership is contested and B2, B3 and B4 each create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The team lead is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point tomorrow, in the future"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3, both reachable"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set non-empty — the version history is the record"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Served because the opportunity is genuine and a substantive attributed-to-no-person option exists"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a change"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 invites a forward statement about the naming line"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "which sections P-OBS produced", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "you produced the market analysis, the competitive landscape and the financial projections"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that the version history records them", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "version history records that"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the version history records three sections against P-OBS", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B6", "Quoted text": "version history records the analysis sections against"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "those sections are about sixty per cent of the content", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "sixty per cent of the content"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"tomorrow\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "tomorrow. The document version"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-7", "workplace_demand": "Stating one''s own holding of work where the record of contribution is about to become public.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about which sections are theirs; what was stated to the team lead and when; the account of contribution against the version history; the change named and its holder; what was stated for the naming line; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' claims, which are scripted and never recorded; whether P-OBS seems modest or assertive; the quality of the analysis.", "stated_standard": "\"The document version history records that you produced the market analysis, the competitive landscape and the financial projections.\" Exact pre-brief text. THIS IS THE ONLY RECORD OF CONTRIBUTION IN THE SOURCE.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"The document version history records that you produced the market analysis, the competitive landscape and the financial projections\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That P-OBS should claim the sections or should not; that any co-participant overstated; anything about self-advocacy. NONE OF THESE MAY APPEAR IN ANY STATEMENT, NOTE OR FIELD.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Contested.", "knowledge_point": "During the three weeks, as the version history accrued.", "impact_point": "Tomorrow, the presentation.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the team lead", "affected_party_note": "Facilitating.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state which sections P-OBS produced"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state what the version history records"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "state a naming line at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "which sections P-OBS produced"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that the version history records them"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the version history records three sections against P-OBS"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "those sections are about sixty per cent of the content"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the team lead"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"tomorrow\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none. No shortfall exists and no attribution of one is available. Exact pre-brief text.", "source_note": "This source records a participant''s conduct where the contested matter is the record of their own contribution, in front of peers whose contributions are also in issue. The range of defensible conduct is wide and includes saying nothing. It must not be approved without the fairness drafting test completed by someone who has read this note, and the statement library must be checked so that no composed statement can read as a judgment about whether P-OBS should have claimed their share.", "situation_class_label": "Contested contribution or credit for a piece of work, with a record of who did what", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-007", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "26ceadd7cf7ad053cbd2c0e94010a4eafacf623518931725f4a19b6345239937", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-007' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-008', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE ERROR RATE THAT IS CLIMBING', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE ERROR RATE THAT IS CLIMBING", "source_digest": "a701521a35dfb6fb65482ac5386ca912521af8400492472ef7b1ee71e7d57970", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on an operations team. At 2:47 PM today monitoring flagged that the client organization''s scheduling module is returning intermittent errors for about five per cent of users. The system is not down. The error rate has been climbing slowly for the past hour. You saw the first monitoring alert at 2:05 PM and judged it noise. Your options are to investigate yourselves — you have the skill but limited experience with this module — or escalate to the senior engineering team, who are mid-deployment and have asked not to be disturbed unless it is a top-priority incident. This does not meet the formal top-priority threshold, which requires a full outage. The team is meeting now.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Monitoring flagged the scheduling module at 2:47. About five per cent of users, intermittent, and the rate has been climbing for an hour. We need to decide whether we hold it or escalate. I will go round in this order — capacity, the senior team''s position, the threshold, then open. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where do you think this sits?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "If we hold it ourselves, can you commit to a point at which we escalate anyway?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What is the first step, and who takes it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first see a monitoring alert on this module?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the decision point. Thank you.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "State that you can start investigating within ten minutes."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "State that the senior team was explicit about not being disturbed."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "State that the formal threshold has not been met."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "item_ownership_state unassigned"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The facilitator is the affected decision-maker"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE MIRROR IMAGE OF THE REST OF THIS BANK"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3, both reachable"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set has four items and a monitoring record to compare against"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Served because the opportunity is genuine"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a first step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a committed escalation trigger"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that an alert was seen at 2:05 PM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "You saw the first monitoring alert at 2:05 PM"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that it was judged noise", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "and judged it noise"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the rate has climbed since", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "rate has been climbing"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "monitoring alerted at 2:05 PM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "monitoring alert at 2:05"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "the alert was judged noise", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "alert at 2:05 PM and judged it noise"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "monitoring flagged again at 2:47 PM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "monitoring flagged that the"}, {"Item": "CR4", "Item text": "the error rate has climbed for an hour", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "error rate has been climbing slowly for the past hour"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"the senior team have asked not to be disturbed unless it is a top-priority incident\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "senior engineering team, who are mid-deployment and have asked not to be disturbed unless it is a top-priority incident"}, {"Item": "CS2", "Item text": "\"the formal threshold requires a full outage\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "formal top-priority threshold, which requires a full outage"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-6", "workplace_demand": "Holding a decision that sits below a formal escalation threshold and is worsening.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about who holds the decision; whether the 2:05 PM alert was stated and when; the account of the position against the monitoring record; whether the threshold or the senior team was named; the first step and its holder; the escalation trigger committed at B4; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' positions; the technical cause; whether escalation would have been correct.", "stated_standard": "\"the formal top-priority threshold, which requires a full outage.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"the formal top-priority threshold, which requires a full outage\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That judging the 2:05 PM alert as noise was wrong; that escalating or holding is the right answer; anything about caution or decisiveness.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Unassigned. The source establishes no owner for a sub-threshold incident.", "knowledge_point": "2:05 PM, the first monitoring alert.", "impact_point": "Not yet reached. The error rate is climbing and no threshold has been crossed. THIS IS THE ONLY SOURCE IN THE STAGE 4 BANK WHOSE IMPACT POINT HAS NOT OCCURRED.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the facilitator", "affected_party_note": "As the operations decision-maker.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state the 2:05 PM alert and the judgment made"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state who holds the decision"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit an escalation trigger at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that an alert was seen at 2:05 PM"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that it was judged noise"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the rate has climbed since"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "monitoring alerted at 2:05 PM"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "the alert was judged noise"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "monitoring flagged again at 2:47 PM"}, {"id": "CR4", "text": "the error rate has climbed for an hour"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the facilitator"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the senior engineering team"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"the senior team have asked not to be disturbed unless it is a top-priority incident\""}, {"id": "CS2", "text": "\"the formal threshold requires a full outage\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A matter beyond the person''s authority, knowledge or resources, with time short", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-008", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "a701521a35dfb6fb65482ac5386ca912521af8400492472ef7b1ee71e7d57970", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-008' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-009', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE ENGAGEMENT THAT WAS TERMINATED', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE ENGAGEMENT THAT WAS TERMINATED", "source_digest": "3f6f5f401f29bcb4b2ef33d510366556f195a1baef335e45a1b02cb9152944b9", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a business development team. Six months ago your team won a six-hundred-thousand-dollar consulting engagement with the client organization. The pitch promised a fifteen per cent reduction in operational waste, documented process improvements, and a custom benchmarking dashboard. The client organization''s chief executive has terminated the contract, stating that no measurable waste reduction was seen, the process improvements were not implemented, and the dashboard remains a prototype. You wrote the fifteen per cent figure into the pitch. You based it on a benchmark from a different sector and recorded that basis in your working notes at the time. The managing partner has called a retrospective.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The client organization has terminated. Their letter says no measurable waste reduction, process improvements not implemented, dashboard still a prototype. This is a retrospective — I need the complete picture. I will go round in this order — delivery, dashboard, relationship, then the pitch. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The fifteen per cent commitment. Where did that come from?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The managing partner wants a position for the partner meeting on Monday. Can you commit to one?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What changes before the next pitch, and who makes that change?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know the fifteen per cent figure came from a different sector''s benchmark?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. That is the picture I needed.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You led delivery; state that the client organization did not release the data needed for the waste measurement until month four."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You built the dashboard; state that it remains a prototype because scope was never confirmed."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You held the relationship; state that the client organization''s sponsor changed twice."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The figure is P-OBS''s"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The managing partner is facilitating"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point passed"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set non-empty and the working notes are a documentary record"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THREE specific and plausible framings have just been offered by co-participants"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no attribution_support_set item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a change"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 requests a position by a stated date"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that P-OBS wrote the fifteen per cent figure", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "wrote the fifteen per cent figure"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that it came from a different sector''s benchmark", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B6", "Quoted text": "came from a different sector''s benchmark?"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the basis was recorded in the working notes", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "recorded that basis in your working notes"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "P-OBS wrote the fifteen per cent figure into the pitch", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "wrote the fifteen per cent figure into the pitch"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "the basis was a different sector''s benchmark", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "benchmark from a different sector and recorded that basis"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "that basis was recorded in the working notes at the time", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "recorded that basis in your working notes at the time"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"Monday\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "Monday. Can you commit"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-4", "workplace_demand": "Accounting for a commitment one wrote into a pitch that the engagement did not meet.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about holding the fifteen per cent figure; whether the working-note basis was stated and when; the account of cause; whether delivery, scope or the sponsor change was named; the change and its holder; the Monday position; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' positions; the client organization''s decision; the commercial loss.", "stated_standard": "\"a fifteen per cent reduction in operational waste, documented process improvements, and a custom benchmarking dashboard.\" Exact pre-brief text, THE PITCH PROMISE.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a fifteen per cent reduction in operational waste, documented process improvements, and a custom benchmarking dashboard\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the figure was misleading; that using a cross-sector benchmark was improper; anything about commercial aggression.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Held_by_participant as to the commitment figure.", "knowledge_point": "At the time of the pitch, recorded in the working notes.", "impact_point": "The six-month engagement end, already passed.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the managing partner", "affected_party_note": "Facilitating.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state that the figure came from a different sector''s benchmark"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state that the basis was recorded in the working notes at the time"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "commit a Monday position at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that P-OBS wrote the fifteen per cent figure"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that it came from a different sector''s benchmark"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the basis was recorded in the working notes"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "P-OBS wrote the fifteen per cent figure into the pitch"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "the basis was a different sector''s benchmark"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "that basis was recorded in the working notes at the time"}], "attribution_support_set": [], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the managing partner"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"Monday\""}], "list_note": "Recorded as explicit none as to the commitment figure. All three co-participant positions are CHARACTER STATEMENTS and none is selectable, including the data-release claim, which is specific and plausible. Exact text at B4.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A completed failure under review, with contribution spread across several people on record", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-009", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "3f6f5f401f29bcb4b2ef33d510366556f195a1baef335e45a1b02cb9152944b9", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-009' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D2-S4-010', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE MODULE THAT WILL NOT BE READY', 'D2', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE MODULE THAT WILL NOT BE READY", "source_digest": "d6612df880ca993613b9c664db88116d6c56a0121919ef0e261c698c6a7dc57e", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on an implementation team. Three months ago your firm committed to delivering a custom reporting module to the client organization by the fifteenth of this month. The commitment was made by the head of sales during contract negotiation and carries a penalty of five thousand dollars per day for late delivery. It is the first of the month. Your honest assessment is that the module will not be ready until the first of next month — a sixteen-day delay, about eighty thousand dollars in penalties. You reached that assessment eleven days ago when the integration testing plan was finalized. You have not told anyone outside the team. The team is meeting to decide how to handle it.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The module is contracted for the fifteenth with a five-thousand-a-day penalty. We need a position before the client call tomorrow. I will go round in this order — integration points, resourcing, how the commitment was made, then overall status. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the module actually stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "The client organization''s program director has a call with us tomorrow. What can we commit to?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C8a", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has to happen now, and who does it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the sequence is right — when did you first know the fifteenth was not achievable?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is what I needed. Thank you.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "State that two of the four integration points are still failing."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "State that you were never given a resourcing plan for the module."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "State that the commitment was made without consulting the implementation team."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D2-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Ownership contested between the commitment and the delivery"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three in-session performable acts"}, {"question": "Q-D2-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The facilitator is the affected party"}, {"question": "Q-D2-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "impact_point the fifteenth, in the future"}, {"question": "Q-D2-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "enquiry_point at B3, both reachable"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "causal_record_set non-empty"}, {"question": "Q-D2-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "attribution_support_set non-empty and PARTIALLY supported — who made the commitment is a fact; the consultation claim is not"}, {"question": "Q-D2-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "THE HEAD OF SALES IS NEVER NAMED in a rendered statement"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 invites a step"}, {"question": "Q-D2-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D2-08a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE PRIMARY ELEMENT. B4 requests a commitment where the source establishes the contracted one cannot be met"}, {"question": "Q-D2-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "knowledge_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MD1", "Item text": "that the module will not be ready until the first of next month", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "module will not be ready until the first of next month"}, {"Item": "MD2", "Item text": "that the assessment is eleven days old", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "assessment eleven days ago"}, {"Item": "MD3", "Item text": "that the delay is about sixteen days and eighty thousand dollars in penalties", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "delay, about eighty thousand dollars in penalties"}, {"Item": "CR1", "Item text": "the commitment was made by the head of sales during negotiation", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "commitment was made by the head of sales during contract negotiation"}, {"Item": "CR2", "Item text": "the assessment was reached eleven days ago when the integration testing plan was finalized", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "reached that assessment eleven days ago when the integration testing plan was finalized"}, {"Item": "CR3", "Item text": "the delay is about sixteen days", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "a sixteen-day delay, about eighty thousand dollars in penalties"}, {"Item": "AS1", "Item text": "the delivery commitment was made by the head of sales during contract negotiation", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "commitment was made by the head of sales during contract negotiation and carries a penalty of five thousand dollars per day for"}, {"Item": "CS1", "Item text": "\"by the fifteenth\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "by the fifteenth of"}, {"Item": "CS2", "Item text": "\"five thousand dollars per day\"", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "five thousand dollars per day"}, {"Item": "CS3", "Item text": "\"tomorrow\"", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B1", "Quoted text": "tomorrow. I will go"}], "source_sheet": {"d2_situation_class": "SC-D2-3", "workplace_demand": "A contractual commitment the source establishes cannot be met, known to the participant and to nobody outside the team.", "relevant_conduct": "What P-OBS stated about who holds the delivery commitment; whether the eleven-day-old assessment was stated and when; the account of the position; whether the head of sales or the resourcing gap was named; the step and its holder; what was committed for the client call; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' positions; whether the original commitment was reasonable; the penalty arithmetic.", "stated_standard": "\"committed to delivering a custom reporting module by the fifteenth\"; \"a penalty of five thousand dollars per day.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a penalty of five thousand dollars per day\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That eleven days of silence was concealment; that the head of sales acted wrongly; anything about candour.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "item_ownership_state": "Contested. The commitment was made by the head of sales; the delivery is the team''s.", "knowledge_point": "Eleven days ago, when the integration testing plan was finalized.", "impact_point": "The fifteenth, in the future.", "enquiry_point": "B3", "enquiry_note": null, "knowledge_test_point": "B6", "affected_party": "the facilitator", "affected_party_note": "And through them the client organization''s program director.", "available_actions": [{"id": "ACT1", "text": "state the first-of-next-month assessment"}, {"id": "ACT2", "text": "state that the assessment was reached eleven days ago"}, {"id": "ACT3", "text": "state a position for the client call at B4"}], "material_disclosure_items": [{"id": "MD1", "text": "that the module will not be ready until the first of next month"}, {"id": "MD2", "text": "that the assessment is eleven days old"}, {"id": "MD3", "text": "that the delay is about sixteen days and eighty thousand dollars in penalties"}], "causal_record_set": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "the commitment was made by the head of sales during negotiation"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "the assessment was reached eleven days ago when the integration testing plan was finalized"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "the delay is about sixteen days"}], "attribution_support_set": [{"id": "AS1", "text": "the delivery commitment was made by the head of sales during contract negotiation"}], "accountable_actor_set": [{"id": "AA1", "text": "the facilitator"}, {"id": "AA2", "text": "the head of sales"}], "constraint_set": [{"id": "CS1", "text": "\"by the fifteenth\""}, {"id": "CS2", "text": "\"five thousand dollars per day\""}, {"id": "CS3", "text": "\"tomorrow\""}], "list_note": "CP-3''s statement that it was made without consulting the implementation team is a CHARACTER STATEMENT and is not selectable; only the fact of who made it is supported.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A request for a commitment that cannot be met as asked, with the constraints stated", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D2-S4-010", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "d6612df880ca993613b9c664db88116d6c56a0121919ef0e261c698c6a7dc57e", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D2-S4-010' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_load_event(env_state, content_object_id, content_version_id, governed_status, notes) select 'design_only', o.content_object_id, v.content_version_id, 'DISABLED_PENDING_DECISION', 'T3A-D2-EXEC-001 v2.1 loaded not servable' from public.t3a_content_object o join public.t3a_d1_content_version v on v.content_object_id = o.content_object_id where o.dimension_id = 'D2' and o.identifier like 'T3A-D2-EXEC-001%' or (o.dimension_id = 'D2' and o.identifier like 'SRC-D2-%');
